UnitPoolFactoryIndexation::CreatePoolHook
├── when tokenA is present in tokenIndex set
│   ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenA to poolByTokenIndex
│   ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenB to poolByTokenIndex
│   ├── it pushes pool and timestamp to poolsIndex
│   └── it adds tokenB to tokenIndex
├── when tokenB is present in tokenIndex set
│   ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenA to poolByTokenIndex
│   ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenB to poolByTokenIndex
│   ├── it pushes pool and timestamp to poolsIndex
│   └── it adds tokenA to tokenIndex
├── when tokenA and tokenB are present in tokenIndex set
│   ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenA to poolByTokenIndex
│   ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenB to poolByTokenIndex
│   └── it pushes pool and timestamp to poolsIndex
└── when tokenA and B aren't present in tokenIndex set
    ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenA to poolByTokenIndex
    ├── it pushes pool keyed by tokenB to poolByTokenIndex
    ├── it pushes pool and timestamp to poolsIndex
    ├── it adds tokenA to tokenIndex
    └── it adds tokenB to tokenIndex
